Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(update): check updates against the
 waenhancer-material releases

The update dialog and the home card query this build's own releases instead of
Dev4Mod's, and "Update" opens the release page instead of the Telegram channel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
